{"meta":{"id":"tt0082348","type":"movie","name":"Excalibur","imdb_id":"tt0082348","description":"Tras una larga y cruenta guerra, Uther Pendragon le ruega al mago Merlín que le ayude a seducir a la esposa de su nuevo aliado, el Duque de Cornwall. Merlín accede, pero a condición de que el fruto de esa unión le sea entregado. Esa misma noche, es concebido Arturo. Dieciocho años después, los nobles de un reino cuyo trono está vacante intentan apoderarse de Excalibur, la espada mágica que está incrustada en una piedra desde la muerte de Uther.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0082348.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qrnNj4lCPcBzmeOaHb7pLV9JKyg.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oGzegvdSPNVvbC68ADby2nZAlSp.png","genres":["Aventura","Fantasía"],"releaseInfo":"1981","released":"1981-04-10T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"141 min","imdbRating":"7.3","country":"United States of America","cast":["Nigel Terry","Nicol Williamson","Helen Mirren","Nicholas Clay","Paul Geoffrey","Cherie Lunghi","Robert Addie","Gabriel Byrne","Keith Buckley","Katrine Boorman","Corin Redgrave","Liam Neeson","Niall O'Brien","Patrick Stewart","Clive Swift","Ciarán Hinds","Liam O'Callaghan","Michael Muldoon","Charley Boorman","Brid Brennan","Garrett Keogh","Emmet Bergin","Eamon Kelly","Gerard Mannix Flynn","Barbara Byrne","Kay Maclaren","Joelle Hélary","Conor Lambert","Prudence Wright Holmes","Paul Markey"],"director":["John Boorman"],"writer":["John Boorman","Thomas Malory","Rospo Pallenberg"],"trailers":[{"source":"vw8oPabVbeY","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"vw8oPabVbeY","lang":"en"},{"source":"knJQxaO5Bt4","type":"Trailer","name":"Original Trailer","ytId":"knJQxaO5Bt4","lang":"en"},{"source":"6QR6_17mn5s","type":"Trailer","name":"Trailer 1","ytId":"6QR6_17mn5s","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"vw8oPabVbeY","title":"Official Trailer"},{"ytId":"knJQxaO5Bt4","title":"Original